{"surah":104,"verses":[{"n":1,"key":"104:1","arabic":"وَيۡلٞ لِّكُلِّ هُمَزَةٖ لُّمَزَةٍ","page":601,"juz":30,"en":"Woe to every scorner and mocker","id":"Celakalah bagi setiap pengumpat dan pencela,","words":[{"a":"وَيۡلٞ","en":"Woe","id":"Woe"},{"a":"لِّكُلِّ","en":"to every","id":"to every"},{"a":"هُمَزَةٖ","en":"slanderer","id":"slanderer"},{"a":"لُّمَزَةٍ","en":"backbiter","id":"backbiter"}]},{"n":2,"key":"104:2","arabic":"ٱلَّذِي جَمَعَ مَالٗا وَعَدَّدَهُۥ","page":601,"juz":30,"en":"Who collects wealth and [continuously] counts it.","id":"yang mengumpulkan harta dan menghitung-hitungnya,","words":[{"a":"ٱلَّذِي","en":"The one who","id":"The one who"},{"a":"جَمَعَ","en":"collects","id":"collects"},{"a":"مَالٗا","en":"wealth","id":"wealth"},{"a":"وَعَدَّدَهُۥ","en":"and counts it","id":"and counts it"}]},{"n":3,"key":"104:3","arabic":"يَحۡسَبُ أَنَّ مَالَهُۥٓ أَخۡلَدَهُۥ","page":601,"juz":30,"en":"He thinks that his wealth will make him immortal.","id":"dia (manusia) mengira bahwa hartanya itu dapat mengekalkannya.","words":[{"a":"يَحۡسَبُ","en":"Thinking","id":"Thinking"},{"a":"أَنَّ","en":"that","id":"that"},{"a":"مَالَهُۥٓ","en":"his wealth","id":"his wealth"},{"a":"أَخۡلَدَهُۥ","en":"will make him immortal","id":"will make him immortal"}]},{"n":4,"key":"104:4","arabic":"كـَلَّاۖ لَيُنۢبَذَنَّ فِي ٱلۡحُطَمَةِ","page":601,"juz":30,"en":"No! He will surely be thrown into the Crusher.","id":"Sekali-kali tidak! Pasti dia akan dilemparkan ke dalam (neraka) Ḥuṭamah.","words":[{"a":"كـَلَّاۖ","en":"Nay","id":"Nay"},{"a":"لَيُنۢبَذَنَّ","en":"Surely he will be thrown","id":"Surely he will be thrown"},{"a":"فِي","en":"in","id":"in"},{"a":"ٱلۡحُطَمَةِ","en":"the Crusher","id":"the Crusher"}]},{"n":5,"key":"104:5","arabic":"وَمَآ أَدۡرَىٰكَ مَا ٱلۡحُطَمَةُ","page":601,"juz":30,"en":"And what can make you know what is the Crusher?","id":"Dan tahukah kamu apakah (neraka) Ḥuṭamah itu?","words":[{"a":"وَمَآ","en":"And what","id":"And what"},{"a":"أَدۡرَىٰكَ","en":"will make you know","id":"will make you know"},{"a":"مَا","en":"what","id":"what"},{"a":"ٱلۡحُطَمَةُ","en":"the Crusher (is)","id":"the Crusher (is)"}]},{"n":6,"key":"104:6","arabic":"نَارُ ٱللَّهِ ٱلۡمُوقَدَةُ","page":601,"juz":30,"en":"It is the fire of Allāh, [eternally] fueled,","id":"(Yaitu) api (azab) Allah yang dinyalakan,","words":[{"a":"نَارُ","en":"A Fire","id":"A Fire"},{"a":"ٱللَّهِ","en":"Allah","id":"Allah"},{"a":"ٱلۡمُوقَدَةُ","en":"kindled","id":"kindled"}]},{"n":7,"key":"104:7","arabic":"ٱلَّتِي تَطَّلِعُ عَلَى ٱلۡأَفۡـِٔدَةِ","page":601,"juz":30,"en":"Which mounts directed at the hearts.","id":"yang (membakar) sampai ke hati.","words":[{"a":"ٱلَّتِي","en":"Which","id":"Which"},{"a":"تَطَّلِعُ","en":"mounts up","id":"mounts up"},{"a":"عَلَى","en":"to","id":"to"},{"a":"ٱلۡأَفۡـِٔدَةِ","en":"the hearts","id":"the hearts"}]},{"n":8,"key":"104:8","arabic":"إِنَّهَا عَلَيۡهِم مُّؤۡصَدَةٞ","page":601,"juz":30,"en":"Indeed, it [i.e., Hellfire] will be closed down upon them","id":"Sungguh, api itu ditutup rapat atas (diri) mereka,","words":[{"a":"إِنَّهَا","en":"Indeed, it","id":"Indeed, it"},{"a":"عَلَيۡهِم","en":"(will be) upon them","id":"(will be) upon them"},{"a":"مُّؤۡصَدَةٞ","en":"closed over","id":"closed over"}]},{"n":9,"key":"104:9","arabic":"فِي عَمَدٖ مُّمَدَّدَةِۭ","page":601,"juz":30,"en":"In extended columns.","id":"(sedang mereka itu) diikat pada tiang-tiang yang panjang.","words":[{"a":"فِي","en":"In","id":"In"},{"a":"عَمَدٖ","en":"columns","id":"columns"},{"a":"مُّمَدَّدَةِۭ","en":"extended","id":"extended"}]}]}